{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08035","headline":"于阗采花 · 李白","name":"于阗采花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"于阗采花人，自言花相似。\n明妃一朝西入胡，胡中美女多羞死。\n乃知汉地多名姝，胡中无花可方比。\n丹青能令丑者妍，无盐翻在深宫里。\n自古妬蛾眉，胡沙埋皓齿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08035.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08035","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}